<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Thongchai Winichakul</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1957">1957</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Thongchai Winichakul is a Thai historian, long a professor at the University of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wisconsin">Wisconsin</a>–Madison. In Siam Mapped: A History of the Geo-Body of a Nation (1994) he argued that modern mapping and the boundary treaties of the late nineteenth century created the idea of Siam as a territorial nation. As a student leader he was arrested in the Thammasat University massacre of 1976.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thongchai-winichakul.jpg" alt="Thongchai Winichakul" width="320" height="358" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: ประชาไท · CC BY-SA 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E0%B8%98%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A2_%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%88%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%A5_2563.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Within the remaining territory, Chulalongkorn’s reforms created a centralised bureaucratic state whose provinces, ministries, railways and schools shaped modern Thailand, and the historian <b>Thongchai Winichakul</b> has shown how mapping and treaty borders in this period produced the modern idea of Siam as a bounded national territory.</blockquote><a href="/empire/rattanakosin-kingdom">Rattanakosin Kingdom · Global &amp; Regional Impact</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bangkok">Bangkok</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/thailand">Thailand</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=13.75,100.52&amp;year=1992" aria-label="Bangkok on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="7304 1652 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Thongchai Winichakul"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M7754 1922h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M7754 1922h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=13.75,100.52&amp;year=1992">What was here in 1992? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
